Package: ricebowl-wayland-session
Version: 0.1.0~preview1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CopyPasteUser
Depends: labwc, waybar, foot, fuzzel, swaylock, dbus-user-session, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
Recommends: xwayland, swaybg, swayidle, wl-clipboard
Description: Optional preview login session for RiceBowl on labwc
 Installs a separate Wayland session chooser entry, a small launcher which
 delegates to the user's RiceBowl installation, and desktop-specific portal
 selection. It does not replace XFCE or change the default login session.
